155=33.	May it be acceptable (?) to you! 

{C.34 = 34-40}
159=34.	As you eat, flax comes into being, grain comes into being. 
163=35.	As you drink, early floods come into being in the rivers. 
167=36.	As you eat, mottled grain comes into being in the fields. 
171=37.	Accept what the righteous man has brought to you! 
